---
// Why ignoring a discounted rights issue (e.g., 2:1 at 10,000 VND when market is 25,000 VND) guarantees an immediate loss.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 295;
---
<figure class="sbp5-rights">
  <div class="sbp5-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Example 2:1 rights issue at 10,000 VND when stock trades at 25,000 VND: reference price drops to 20,000 VND (-20%). Investors who exercise put in 10M cash and hold 3,000 shares worth 60M (neutral). Investors who forget to exercise still hold 2,000 shares now worth 40M (-10M instant wealth drop).">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp5-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Rights issue 2:1 at 10,000 VND (stock at 25k): exercising vs forgetting the deadline</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Quyền mua 2:1 giá 10.000 đ (thị giá 25k): nộp tiền mua vs quên hạn đăng ký</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Setup bar */}
      <rect x="20" y="50" width="860" height="46" rx="8" class="sbp5-card" />
      <text x="38" y="78" class="sbp5-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Start: 2,000 shares @ 25,000 = 50M VND → Ex-Date adjusted ref = (2×25,000 + 1×10,000) ÷ 3 = 20,000 VND (−20%)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ban đầu: 2.000 CP × 25.000 = 50 triệu → Giá tham chiếu GDKHQ = (2×25.000 + 1×10.000) ÷ 3 = 20.000 đồng (−20%)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Path A: Exercise */}
      <rect x="20" y="114" width="420" height="156" rx="10" class="sbp5-card-green" />
      <DiagramIcon name="check" x={48} y={144} size={24} />
      <text x="74" y="148" class="sbp5-hdr sbp5-green">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Option A: Exercise right (or transfer right)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cách A: Nộp 10 triệu mua thêm 1.000 CP (hoặc bán quyền)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="182" class="sbp5-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Put in +10,000,000 VND (1,000 × 10k par)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Bỏ thêm +10.000.000 đ mua 1.000 CP mới</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="210" class="sbp5-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Own 3,000 shares @ 20,000 = 60,000,000 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Nắm 3.000 CP × 20.000 = 60.000.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="242" class="sbp5-sub sbp5-green">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Net wealth change: 0 VND (50M + 10M cash = 60M)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tài sản ròng không hao hụt: 50M + 10M = 60M</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Path B: Do nothing */}
      <rect x="460" y="114" width="420" height="156" rx="10" class="sbp5-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={488} y={144} size={24} />
      <text x="514" y="148" class="sbp5-hdr sbp5-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Option B: Forget &amp; miss the cutoff date</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cách B: Bỏ mặc &amp; quên hạn nộp tiền tại app</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="182" class="sbp5-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Price STILL adjusts down to 20,000 VND (−20%)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Giá sàn VẪN bị kéo về 20.000 đồng (−20%)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="210" class="sbp5-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• You still only hold 2,000 shares @ 20,000 = 40M</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Bạn chỉ còn 2.000 CP × 20.000 = 40.000.000 đ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="242" class="sbp5-sub sbp5-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Net wealth change: −10,000,000 VND wiped instantly!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thiệt hại tức thì: mất trắng −10.000.000 đồng!</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Unlike cash or stock dividends that arrive automatically, a rights issue requires an active choice before the deadline: either subscribe, transfer your rights during the broker window, or sell the stock BEFORE Ex-Date.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Khác với cổ tức tự động về ví, quyền mua phát hành thêm buộc bạn phải hành động trước hạn: nộp tiền đăng ký, chuyển nhượng quyền trong thời hạn mở cổng, hoặc bán cổ phiếu trước Ngày GDKHQ nếu không muốn nộp thêm tiền.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp5-rights { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp5-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp5-rights svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp5-rights text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp5-title { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp5-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp5-card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp5-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp5-hdr { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp5-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp5-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp5-body { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp5-sub { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp5-rights figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
